; Stage 15 W4b sibling sweep (design/stage15-stress-test/diagnostics.md
; §W4b): `defenum`'s own name never takes a type annotation. Before the fix,
; a bare colon-typed name ("E:i32") sailed past `emit-defenum`'s checks
; unchanged and silently registered nothing under a lookupable "E" -- the
; flat members (A, B, C) still defined fine as plain i32 constants, so the
; only observable symptom was that the EnumDef itself (used by
; tyname-resolvable / match exhaustiveness) silently vanished. Now rejected
; at the `defenum` line.
(defenum E:i32 A B C)

(defn main ():i32
  (return B))
